  "findings": "Compared spring flower form and lacecap detail; red seasonal foliage excluded. Replaced simple leaves with opposite three-lobed foliage and terminal flat corymbs. First pass was too sparse and second too planar; added secondary twig foliage and irregular 3D branching, restaged and actually inspected final seeds 1,4,7 and all 36 variants. Final 1.5-3.5 m irregular shrubs have connected branch-led foliage, modest white spring lacecaps, varied spread and density. Fine serrations and fertile florets remain below 25 mm. Accepted stylized spring source; user variant endorsement remains separate.",
